repository-code: "https://github.com/orchid-calphad/orchid-data"
abstract: "Every paper the ORCHID CALPHAD data project knows about (9568 works, 7812 with DOI): Crossref bibliographic metadata (CC0), the role each paper plays in ORCHID (read, cited original source, assessment behind a TDB file, original evaluation behind an assessed diagram, discovery lead), counts of the evidence ORCHID released from it, and 60233 typed relations with provenance (citations of values, TDB files, reassessments, handbook diagrams, Crossref reference lists). Version 1, machine-extracted."
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.PENDING-orchid-data"
    description: "Umbrella record ORCHID data (all datasets of release v2026.10)"
keywords: [CALPHAD, thermodynamics, bibliography, citation graph, phase diagrams, AI-ready data]
